<title>USA: Daily rate of US aluminum output rises in February.</title>
<headline>Daily rate of US aluminum output rises in February.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The daily rate of primary aluminum production in the U.S. in February rose to 9,901 tonnes, up from 9,851 tonnes in January, the Aluminum Association reported.</p>
<p>The annual rate of production in February was 3,613,865 tonnes, up from 3,595,733 tonnes in January.</p>
<p>Actual production in February was 277,228 tonnes compared to January's 305,391 tonnes.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
